12:21.700 --> 12:23.390
立ち上がれ、輝け。

12:22.390 --> 12:24.460
♪ I lose myself in you ♪

12:23.390 --> 12:25.370
なぜまだ寝ているんだ、お寝坊さん？

12:25.370 --> 12:28.480
♪ The corner of my mouth turn upNsimply at the thought of you ♪

12:25.910 --> 12:27.180
